title: "tinylm: training a small Qwen2-architecture language model from scratch"
abstract: "Data cleaning with MinHash dedup, a byte-level BPE trainer, a hand-written Qwen2 decoder, AdamW and training loop in PyTorch, zero-shot evaluation, and GGUF export for the tinyinfer C engine."
